SUMMARY: Helping Your Family Change Fear into Love—Parent Spiritual Chat
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\nHave you or your c
 hild come into this world with unexplained fears?\n\nAre you looking for t
 ools to give your child the confidence to face their fears?\n\nWould you l
 ike to hear techniques to help open the heart center?\n\n**You are warmly 
 invited to come share your stories!**\n\n“Many people want to know how t
 o get rid of fear. Fear isn’t something you can be talked out of. The se
 cret of getting rid of fear is to open the heart center.\n“In a heart fu
 ll of love\, where is there room for fear?\n“Love dispels fear.”\n—H
 arold Klemp\, *ECK Wisdom on Conquering Fear*\, p. 38\n\n***Explore. . .**
 *\nHow to find a deeper meaning of your child’s fear\nOvercoming fear wi
 th the power of divine love\nSpiritual tools to meet the uncertainties of 
 daily life\nA spiritual exercise of protection\n\n“When God’s love com
 es in\, fears go out\, including the fear of death.”\n—Harold Klemp\, 
 *The Living Word*\, Book 3\, p. 227\n\n**Are you looking for ways to bring
  more spirituality**\n**into your life and the life of your family?**\nWe 
 will be sharing experiences of being a parent and acknowledging and recogn
 izing our own inner knowing.\nIt is exciting to share stories and experien
 ces with like-minded parents. By sharing\, our own inner wisdom can be str
 engthened and validated.\nParent discussions offer family-friendly tools i
 n a relaxed setting for exploring spiritual truths and how we live them.\n
 \nYou're warmly invited to share spiritual insights\, stories\, and experi
 ences\, ask questions\, or simply listen.\n**Parents\, grandparents\, and 
 friends are always welcome.**\n**.**\nClick **[HERE](http://www.eckankar.o
 rg/explore/parents-families/)** to learn about spiritual opportunities for
  parents and families:\n\nClick **[HERE](https://www.adventuresineckparent
 ing.org/se-1/)** to read about how family classes or “satsangs” can st
 rengthen your family’s spiritual connection.
