SUMMARY:Listening to Your Inner Guidance—A Sound of Soul Event
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Do you get a “
 gut feeling” about things?**\n\n**Do you wish you listened to your intui
 tion more?**\n\n**Are you interested in learning how to tune in to your hi
 gher self**\n**to become more aware in your daily life?**\n\nYou are warml
 y invited to experience HU\, the Sound of Soul. Explore this uplifting lov
 e song to God and how it can benefit you in bringing more divine love into
  your daily life.\n\n“Singing *HU* has been practiced for thousands of y
 ears in one form or another for inner attunement. In the same way a musici
 an can use a tuning fork to find the right pitch\, the person singing *HU*
  tunes in to a higher spiritual awareness.\n“HU is a carrier of love bet
 ween you and God.”\n—Harold Klemp\, *The Sound of Soul*\, p. 55\n\nThi
 s is a public event for those who would like to experience the uplifting S
 ound of Soul and its benefits.\n**It includes:**\n• A description of the
  HU song and how to practice it\n• The reading of a contemplative passag
 e\n• A 15-minute HU chant\, followed by quiet contemplation\n• Friendl
 y\, spiritual conversation\, sharing insights and asking questions\n\n**Ch
 anting HU can give you:**\n• A greater awareness of inner guidance\n• 
 Connection with divine love\n• Relief from fear\n\n**Open to people of a
 ll faiths and walks of life.**\n**You\, your friends\, and family are invi
 ted!**\n\nLearn more about how to develop a powerful spiritual exercise th
 at can transform your daily life **[HERE](https://eckankarblog.org/hu-app/
 )**\nTo hear thousands of people singing HU and to sing along\, download t
 he free HU app **[HERE](https://www.eckankar.org/experience/hu-the-sound-o
 f-soul/)**
